          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Just Ingredients delivers what it promises on the front of the tub: a short, readable label, natural sweeteners, no gums and a creamy shake that many buyers enjoy. What the front of the tub does not tell you is that part of the 22 g is collagen, that the coconut milk brings real saturated fat, and that you are paying roughly $2.85 per 25 g of protein for the experience.
